  "details": "1. Launch the mobile version of VRChat.\n\n2. Open any large menu such as “World” or “Social” (the screen will be in portrait orientation at this point).\n\n3. When the menu opens and the screen rotates from portrait to landscape, the display may appear distorted.\n\nThis occurs sometimes but not consistently.\n\nThe steps to reproduce and conditions are unknown.\n\nDevice:\n\nSHARP AQUOS sense8 SHG11\n\nAndroid Version:\n\n15\n\nVRChat App Version:\n\n2025.3.4p1-1727-a6601220d0-Release",
